WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.717
A mathematician says

00:00:01.529 --> 00:00:02.684
Claude helped prove

00:00:02.496 --> 00:00:03.144
Riemann

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:05.057
Mathematician Levent

00:00:04.928 --> 00:00:06.237
Alpöge posted a

00:00:06.048 --> 00:00:07.333
short note claiming

00:00:07.463 --> 00:00:08.088
he found a

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.831
proof of the

00:00:08.643 --> 00:00:09.986
Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:10.164 --> 00:00:11.567
working with Anthropic's

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:12.027
Claude

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.351
He says the

00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:14.425
method goes further

00:00:14.637 --> 00:00:16.075
resolving the Generalized

00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:17.184
Riemann Hypothesis

00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:17.526
too

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.222
one of the

00:00:18.034 --> 00:00:19.283
most famous open

00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:20.132
problems in number

00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:20.580
theory

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:21.935
And he says

00:00:21.747 --> 00:00:22.867
the whole argument

00:00:22.678 --> 00:00:24.022
has been formalized

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:24.529
in the Lean

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:25.319
proof assistant

00:00:25.473 --> 00:00:27.006
so other mathematicians

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:27.595
can now check

00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:27.867
it

00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:29.412
Full story on

00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:30.119
the dashboard
